ca-bundle.pem is a PEM conversion of Mozilla's root certificate store
(certdata.txt from the NSS source tree), produced by the curl project's
mk-ca-bundle.pl and published at https://curl.se/docs/caextract.html.

The curl project states that the converted PEM file is licensed under the
same licence as the Mozilla source file: the Mozilla Public License, version
2.0. The file carries no licence text of its own; this notice supplies it.

