v. 2.0. If a copy of the MPL was not distributed with this file, You can
obtain one at https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.

Mozilla's certdata.txt and the derived bundle are distributed under the MPL
2.0 unmodified in substance; the conversion changes the encoding, not the
certificates. The rest of this repository is under its own licence (see the
workspace manifest); the MPL 2.0 covers ca-bundle.pem alone.
